  SYNTAX  INTEGER {ON(1),OFF(0)}
  ACCESS  read-only
  STATUS  current
  DESCRIPTION
  ::= {RTRS-Param 2}
----------------------------------------------------------------------
RTRS-P-Out OBJECT-TYPE
  SYNTAX  INTEGER
  ACCESS  read-only
  STATUS  current
  DESCRIPTION
        "Output power(divider=10,W)"
  ::= {RTRS-Param 3}
----------------------------------------------------------------------
