  SYNTAX  DisplayString
  ACCESS  read-only
  STATUS  mandatory
  DESCRIPTION
          ""
  ::= {BlockControl1-Info 7}

----------------------------------------------------------------------
-----------------------Param-BlockControl-----------------------------
----------------------------------------------------------------------


BlockControl1-PowerOut OBJECT-TYPE
  SYNTAX  INTEGER
  ACCESS  read-only
  STATUS  current
  DESCRIPTION
